  "articleContent": "<div>\n<div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"0\" data-line=\"true\">I am the guide of Mengzhou's civilization, Sentinel Hsin the Moon Fox. Arbiter, at last we meet.</div>\n<div data-zone-id=\"0\" data-line-index=\"1\" data-line=\"true\">Mm. That is a fitting opening for a \"first meeting,\" is it not? But... from now on, please. I insist you call me \"Hsin.\"&mdash;Hsin</div>\n</div>\n<img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1790179200000/t0igwiu17tftzqcza4-1790235991105.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1790179200000/z1r0g1dg4j661lhb30-1790236011394.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1790179200000/xn1nfxtorcj23q7p2y-1790236035989.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1790179200000/1ge8ld37paijy48pkl-1790236062999.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></div>\n<div><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1790179200000/g7sjmquh622p3yggd3-1790236312747.jpg\" width=\"800\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"></div>\n<div><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://hw-media-cdn-mingchao.kurogame.com/object/1790179200000/fn5nfmoinf1kozvvpq-1790236103212.gif\" width=\"800\" height=\"1421\" data-media-source=\"production_G152_en\" data-desc=\"succ\"><img style=\"display